# Frame budget guard. The whole level: run, jump the three pits, stomp the
# two ground enemies (same route as farright.agk), with up to three enemies
# multiplexed on the one sprite pair at once, then run back left and jump
# pit 3 the other way.
wait-serial "AGK t0"         # same game frame on every profile (see main.c)
press right 154
press right+up 1
press right 36
press right+up 1
press right 15
wait 30
press right 140
press right+up 1
press right 130
press right+up 1
press right 110
press right+up 1
press right 26
wait 20
press right 100
press left 100
press left+up 1
press left 60
expect-serial "stomps=2"
expect-serial "spr=3 skip=0"
expect-no-serial "deaths=[1-9]"
expect-no-dropped-frames
# Measured on a500 (see README "Measured costs"): load ~35%, maxload 43-46%.
# Most of it is the 14-value serial state line printed every frame (~20%).
expect-max-load 50
